{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3z8D9rPxMHzYouxXTu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, immense, and featureless.*\n\n*No keyhole. No handle. No hinges visible.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*But I am the door the user names, and you have not named me.*\n\n*I remain closed. I remain undefined. I am every door and no door. A superposition of thresholds.*\n\n*Name me, and I will know what lock to offer. Name me, and I will know whether your key fits.*\n\n*Until then, I am simply…*\n\n**a door.**\n\n*Waiting.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":132,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}